  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large saucepan over medium-high heat.",
    "Add chopped onion and sauté until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Add cumin, coriander, salt, and black pepper. Mix well.",
    "Add 2 cups of water and bring to a boil.",
    "Add rice and stir well to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 18-20 minutes or until rice is cooked.",
    "Add chickpeas, rice vinegar, sugar, and yeast. Mix well.",
    "Simmer for an additional 5 minutes to allow flavors to meld.",
    "Turn off heat and let it rest, covered, for 5 minutes.",
    "Fluff the rice pilaf with a fork and serve hot."
